  "name": "Tomato-Braised Chicken Breasts",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken in a tangy spiced tomato sauce",
  "description": "Flour-coated chicken breasts are browned, then gently cooked in a sweet-tart tomato sauce until tender and fully cooked.",
